# .trivyignore
# This file contains CVEs that are ignored during the CI Trivy scan.
# Format: one CVE ID per line.
# Please include a comment above the ignored CVE explaining why it is considered a false-positive or acceptable risk.

# Example:
# # Ignored because it only affects devDependencies and is mitigated in our runtime
# CVE-2021-3807

